<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">1</span><h2>About the service</h2></div>
    <p class="lead">We build small HTML games, mobile and web apps for brands: for awareness, ad campaigns and audience engagement. From a simple promo mechanic to a mini-app for your goal.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">2</span><h2>What we do</h2></div>
    <ul class="cond">
      <li><b>A promo game</b> for an ad campaign or an event.</li>
      <li><b>A mini-app</b> or web service for a brand.</li>
      <li><b>Mechanics</b> for socials, QR and offline activations.</li>
      <li><b>Brand styling</b> inside the product.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="col">
    <div class="sh"><span class="snum">3</span><h2>Cost</h2></div>
    <div class="callout">
      <div class="lbl">Project cost</div>
      <div class="big">from 2000 €</div>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">Exact quote and timeline by arrangement. Tell me the idea and we'll price it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="close">
  <div class="col">
    <p class="cta">Got an idea for a brand game or app? Tell me the goal and we'll scope and price it.</p>
    <div class="contacts">
      <div class="who">Andrey <span>· Flora Creative Studio</span></div>
      <div>Call or WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+37127775842">+371 27 775 842</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



<!--FLORA-FOOT-->
